{"3807550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mycopsychosys: Remastered", "steam_appid": 3807550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>🍄UPDATES &amp; ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/f8c2567a91cfda5cf96c4642394f69c8.poster.avif?t=1771229822\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/f8c2567a91cfda5cf96c4642394f69c8.webm?t=1771229822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/f8c2567a91cfda5cf96c4642394f69c8.mp4?t=1771229822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/6642ce0f616b5ceaf086b42688c83fc3.avif?t=1771229822\" width=486 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy clouds that contain Mycopsychosys spores are approaching your area. If you want to survive, you have to stay inside your home and closely follow the PCD (plague control department) issued rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you will experience a sporestorm firsthand. You'll be tasked not only with surviving the night but also with taking care of the people around you. Explore the scenario, meet and interact with our charismatic main cast, and decide if you trust them enough to let them inside your house or if you'd rather not risk it. Be carefull, sometimes issolation is not the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/6c883994bde7f31195aadb04d79fea38.avif?t=1771229822\" width=390 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance the experience and to help the player survive, a web page has been created by the PCD containing crucial information about the spores, the infection and about those who fall ill from it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you don't have an active internet connection, we've also included the information inside the &quot;Survivor manual&quot; folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/563be8da20d0e06deed4c0b0c6af195f.avif?t=1771229822\" width=390 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/167e447aa669f6b9d95e4085e7213e09.avif?t=1771229822\" width=486 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/18bd367ee406646fd644d074cbac4d9a.avif?t=1771229822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras_big/18bd367ee406646fd644d074cbac4d9a.avif?t=1771229822 width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/6642ce0f616b5ceaf086b42688c83fc3.avif?t=1771229822\" width=486 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy clouds that contain Mycopsychosys spores are approaching your area. If you want to survive, you have to stay inside your home and closely follow the PCD (plague control department) issued rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you will experience a sporestorm firs